title: "panta-rhei.site — Public Research Observatory of the Panta Rhei Research Program"
abstract: >
  Jekyll source for panta-rhei.site, the public research observatory of the Panta Rhei
  Research Program. The website materializes the program as eight inspection lanes
  (Discover, Program, Agenda, Corpus, Results, Verify, Impact, Engage) with the
  Structural Challenge Ledger as the canonical Agenda-side obligation surface and
  Challenge Responses as the Results-side projection.
